  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3cc8e143b95636a48905855f49fb9185, type: 3}
  m_Name: ForestPrologue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: SafeHaven::PrologueDefinition
  chapters:
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3514f440e604ac048bb77179757dee9b, type: 2}
    behaviour: 9
    arrivalText: There you are. Come and stand by the fire with the rest of us. You should know who you are walking with before we set out.
    statusText: 
    duration: 0
    initialEnemies: 0
    enemies: []
    site: 3
    companions: 0
    timeToTalk: 1
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f630af2f0eaf434a97dc64ffe2d130c, type: 2}
    behaviour: 9
    arrivalText: 'The packs are tied and the fire is nearly out. Ingrid''s party should have been back yesterday, and the forest is half a morning down the road. If you have anything left to do here, do it now: once we set out, we do not come back for it. Are you ready?'
    statusText: 
    duration: 0
    initialEnemies: 0
    enemies: []
    site: 3
    companions: 3
    timeToTalk: 0
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7782d364f6bf30b4ba50ba576e7be27f, type: 2}
    behaviour: 9
    arrivalText: 
    statusText: 
    duration: 0
    initialEnemies: 0
    enemies: []
    site: 0
    companions: 4
    timeToTalk: 0
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0279feb93b7c8b74e9fd8683d9d10fd3, type: 2}
    behaviour: 0
    arrivalText: That was no weather. The sun went down hours early and this storm came out of a clear sky. Ingrid, Bjarne, Tor and Liv walked into this two days ago, so we go on, not back. Keep your torch up and follow the old road into the trees. Find us dry shelter; we will follow you.
    statusText: 
    duration: 0
    initialEnemies: 0
    enemies: []
    site: 3
    companions: 1
    timeToTalk: 0
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4f625534621489e4183de610d93d4f36, type: 2}
    behaviour: 1
    arrivalText: Dry stone overhead. Good work. We need warmth before anyone can think clearly. Gather eight Sticks and twelve Small Rocks nearby; there is loose fuel on the forest floor.
    statusText: 
    duration: 0
    initialEnemies: 0
    enemies: []
    site: 3
    companions: 1
    timeToTalk: 0
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2ba326763b19a9e46be36507850aed82, type: 2}
    behaviour: 2
    arrivalText: That is enough. Let us put your building skills to use. Press G to open Build, choose Campfire and place it on open ground beside the shelter. The supplies you collected will pay for it.
    statusText: Build a Campfire beside the shelter (G)
    duration: 0
    initialEnemies: 0
    enemies: []
    site: 3
    companions: 1
    timeToTalk: 0
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 83fc380c709c01a4383dfa7c9300d48a, type: 2}
    behaviour: 1
    arrivalText: 'Eirik: Warm hands, empty bellies. There are berry bushes in the clearing west of the shelter. Pick five and stew them over the fire; take my waterskin for the pot.'
    statusText: 
    duration: 0
    initialEnemies: 0
    enemies: []
    site: 3
    companions: 1
    timeToTalk: 0
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b2306560eba5c594886d38a592bdb05d, type: 2}
    behaviour: 9
    arrivalText: A fire and a warm meal. Sit, talk to the others, get your breath back. Whatever is out there will still be there when we are done.
    statusText: 'A MOMENT OF WARMTH

      Talk to your companions, or catch your breath.'
    duration: 0
    initialEnemies: 0
    enemies: []
    site: 1
    companions: 1
    timeToTalk: 1
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f76858ea1c6b6043bdee39be76ef0b1, type: 2}
    behaviour: 4
    arrivalText: 'Runa: Wolves! They are not hunting; something is driving them towards us. Protect the camp!'
    statusText: 
    duration: 0
    initialEnemies: 2
    enemies:
    - prefab: {fileID: 4509420567327699722, guid: 133e61ca36473ab4999a603e504581a7, type: 3}
      weight: 1
      fromWave: 1
    site: 3
    companions: 1
    timeToTalk: 0
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cd536373f8f639f4db60c8810e546ebf, type: 2}
    behaviour: 5
    arrivalText: 
    statusText: 'SOMETHING IS COMING

      Follow the old road to the standing stones.'
    duration: 0
    initialEnemies: 0
    enemies: []
    site: 3
    companions: 1
    timeToTalk: 0
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5699d07d5ceee6144855cc88c1a5f255, type: 2}
    behaviour: 6
    arrivalText: These markings are older than the road. Sigrid says they may be a way out, and does not say how she knows. Touch the waystones and see if they still answer. We will hold the clearing.
    statusText: 
    duration: 0
    initialEnemies: 0
    enemies: []
    site: 3
    companions: 1
    timeToTalk: 0
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a089752e48d75934fb5e34dbeec0b389, type: 2}
    behaviour: 7
    arrivalText: 'Sigrid: The stones are drawing power! Hold them off until the connection forms!'
    statusText: 'THE CONNECTION IS WAKING

      Hold them back. Stay close to the portal!'
    duration: 60
    initialEnemies: 4
    enemies:
    - prefab: {fileID: 4509420567327699722, guid: 133e61ca36473ab4999a603e504581a7, type: 3}
      weight: 3
      fromWave: 1
    - prefab: {fileID: 8296844003842886986, guid: 6e3976bda74c8ee47a348b92a853028a, type: 3}
      weight: 2
      fromWave: 1
    - prefab: {fileID: 8277675663346761700, guid: 80e5c084eeb0c7d4d9a3027eabb4a2a8, type: 3}
      weight: 1.5
      fromWave: 2
    site: 3
    companions: 1
    timeToTalk: 0
